sequenceDiagram
    actor Player as Player (user)
    participant Home as Home (screen)
    participant Settings as Settings (screen)
    participant Storage as localStorage (storage)
    participant Quiz as Quiz (screen)
    participant API as OpenTDB (API)

    Note over Home: Categories: General Knowledge (9), Music (12), Geography (22), Film (11), Sports (21), Computers (18)
    opt Change timer in Settings
        Settings->>Storage: Read saved duration
        Note over Settings: Missing or invalid defaults to 15 seconds
        Player->>Settings: Choose duration (3, 5, 7, 10, 15, or 20 seconds)
        Settings->>Storage: Save duration
    end
    Player->>Home: Choose category
    Home->>Quiz: Start new in-memory session for category
    Quiz->>API: Request 10 questions for category
    alt Network, API, or invalid response
        Quiz-->>Player: Show fetch error and offer return home
    else Valid response
        Note over Quiz: Validate and decode question and answer text
        Quiz-->>Player: Show first question
    end
